rvice provider, and only so they can deliver our messages to you.</p> <h2 data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>Sharing With Service Providers</h2> <p data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>We use a small number of trusted service providers to run our business, such as website hosting, email delivery, phone and texting services, and analytics. They only receive the information needed to perform their function and are not permitted to use it for anything else.</p> <h2 data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>Data Retention and Security</h2> <p data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>We keep your information only as long as needed to serve you and meet legal requirements. We use reasonable technical and organizational safeguards to protect it.</p> <h2 data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>Your Choices</h2> <p data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>You can ask us to update or delete your personal information at any time. You can opt out of texts by replying STOP and unsubscribe from emails using the link in any message. To make any other request, contact us and we will take care of it.</p> <h2 data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>Contact Us</h2> <p data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>Questions about this policy or your data can be sent to <a href="mailto:connor@22localmarketing.com" data-astro-cid-fb3qbcs3>connor@22localmarketing.com</a>, or reach us by phone or text at (865) 348-3380. 22 Local Marketing, 7079 Doefield Dr, Kernersville, NC 27284.</p> </div> </main>  <footer data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte> <div class="container" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte> <div class="footer-grid" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte> <div class="footer-brand" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte> <a href="/" class="wordmark" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte><span class="wordmark-dot" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte></span>22 Local Marketing</a> <p data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte>The marketing engine for serious tree and land companies. Built by operators, run for results.</p> </div> <div class="footer-col" data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte> <h4 data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte>What We Do</h4> <ul data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte> <li data-astro-cid-sz7xmlte><a href="/#services" data-ast